sentences.text:
The applicant is ordered to be released on bail in connection with F.I.R. registered as C.R. No. 11993007250022/2025 registered with Gandhidham B-Division Police Station, Kuchchh East - Gandhidham, on executing a bond of Rs.1,00,000/-
(Rupees One Lakh only) with one surety of the like amount to the NEUTRAL CITATION R/CR.MA/2182/2026 ORDER DATED: 03/03/2026 undefined satisfaction of the trial Court and subject to the conditions that he shall;
[a] not take undue advantage of liberty or misuse liberty; [b] not act in a manner injurious to the interest of the prosecution;
[c] surrender passport, if any, to the lower court within a week;
[d] not leave the State of Gujarat without prior permission of the Sessions Court concerned;

